A composite type formed by combining ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/sum-type.td")}s (variants/tagged unions) and product types (tuples/records), enabling precise modeling of data structures like Option, Result, or tree nodes. Synonymous with [Sum of products (SoP)](/plt/concepts/sum-of-products-sop).
